const codes={bubble:['for end = n - 1 down to 1','  for i = 0 to end - 1','    compare blocks[i], blocks[i + 1]','    if blocks[i] > blocks[i + 1]','      swap(blocks[i], blocks[i + 1])','return sorted blocks'],selection:['for i = 0 to n - 2','  smallest = i','  scan remaining blocks','  remember the smallest block','  swap(blocks[i], blocks[smallest])','return sorted blocks'],search:['left = 0; right = n - 1','while left <= right','  middle = floor((left + right) / 2)','  if blocks[middle] == target: found','  if blocks[middle] < target: left = middle + 1','  else: right = middle - 1','return not found']};
function renderUI(){let f=frames[position];$('status').textContent=f.text;$('comparisons').textContent=f.c;$('swaps').textContent=mode==='search'?target:f.s;$('swapsLabel').textContent=mode==='search'?'TARGET':'SWAPS';$('stepCount').textContent=`${position} / ${frames.length-1}`;$('questProgress').style.width=position/(frames.length-1)*100+'%';$('code').innerHTML=codes[mode].map((l,i)=>`<span class="line ${i===f.line?'highlight':''}">${l.replaceAll('<','&lt;')}</span>`).join('');$('step').disabled=position===frames.length-1;draw();}
function pause(){clearTimeout(timer);timer=null;$('play').textContent='▶ PLAY';}function tick(){if(position>=frames.length-1){pause();return;}position++;renderUI();beep();timer=setTimeout(tick,1500/Number($('speed').value));}function play(){if(timer){pause();return;}if(position===frames.length-1)position=0;$('play').textContent='Ⅱ PAUSE';timer=setTimeout(tick,100);}function step(){pause();if(position<frames.length-1){position++;renderUI();beep();}}let audio;function beep(){if(!sound)return;audio??=new AudioContext();audio.resume();let o=audio.createOscillator(),g=audio.createGain();o.type='square';o.frequency.value=220+frames[position].c%5*70;g.gain.setValueAtTime(.025,audio.currentTime);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+.08);o.connect(g);g.connect(audio.destination);o.start();o.stop(audio.currentTime+.08);}
function setMode(m){mode=m;$('algorithm').value=m;if(m==='search')values.sort((a,b)=>a-b);$('title').textContent=m==='search'?'Search Quarry':'Sorting Plains';$('lessonTitle').textContent={bubble:'Bubble sort',selection:'Selection sort',search:'Binary search'}[m];$('complexity').textContent=m==='search'?'O(log n) time · O(1) space':'O(n²) time · O(1) space';$('description').textContent={bubble:'Compare neighboring towers. If the left one is taller, swap them. Each pass moves the largest remaining block to its place.',selection:'Find the smallest remaining tower and move it to the front. Repeat until every block has found its place.',search:'Start with sorted blocks. Inspect the middle tower and discard half the search area. Repeat until you find your target.'}[m];document.querySelectorAll('.topic').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',(m==='search')===(b.dataset.mode==='search')));prepare();}
function draw(){const w=canvas.clientWidth,h=canvas.clientHeight,dpr=devicePixelRatio||1;if(canvas.width!==w*dpr||canvas.height!==h*dpr){canvas.width=w*dpr;canvas.height=h*dpr;}ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);let sky=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,h);sky.addColorStop(0,'#8dbbc6');sky.addColorStop(.65,'#c3d6c0');sky.addColorStop(1,'#8eac77');ctx.fillStyle=sky;ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);ctx.fillStyle='#fff0b8';ctx.fillRect(w*.78,39,40,40);ctx.fillStyle='#edf3e3';[[.1,53,70],[.38,27,95],[.65,85,60]].forEach(([x,y,size])=>{ctx.fillRect(w*x,y,size,15);ctx.fillRect(w*x+18,y-10,size-28,10);});ctx.fillStyle='#81a897';for(let i=0;i<11;i++){let x=i*w/10;ctx.fillRect(x,h*.38-(i%3)*14,w/10+2,h*.62);}const scale=Math.min(w/24,h/15)*zoom,ox=w*.5,oy=h*.55;function point(x,y,z){let xx=x*Math.cos(angle)-y*Math.sin(angle),yy=x*Math.sin(angle)+y*Math.cos(angle);return[ox+(xx-yy)*scale,oy+(xx+yy)*scale*.45-z*scale*.75];}function poly(points,col){ctx.beginPath();points.forEach((p,i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(...p):ctx.moveTo(...p));ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle=col;ctx.fill();ctx.strokeStyle='#152c1826';ctx.lineWidth=.6;ctx.stroke();}function cube(x,y,z,type){let p=palette[type]||palette.grass,A=point(x,y,z+1),B=point(x+1,y,z+1),C=point(x+1,y+1,z+1),D=point(x,y+1,z+1),E=point(x,y+1,z),F=point(x+1,y+1,z),G=point(x+1,y,z);poly([D,C,F,E],p[1]);poly([B,C,F,G],p[2]);poly([A,B,C,D],p[0]);let q=point(x+.25,y+.3,z+1.008),r=point(x+.48,y+.55,z+1.008);ctx.fillStyle='#ffffff12';ctx.fillRect(q[0],q[1],Math.max(2,scale*.12),2);ctx.fillStyle='#12220813';ctx.fillRect(r[0],r[1],scale*.17,2);}
let objects=[];for(let x=-8;x<9;x++)for(let y=-5;y<6;y++){if((Math.abs(x)>6&&Math.abs(y)>3)||((x*7+y*11)%17===0&&Math.abs(x)>5))continue;objects.push({x,y,z:-2,t:'dirt'},{x,y,z:-1,t:'grass'});}function tree(x,y){for(let z=0;z<3;z++)objects.push({x,y,z,t:'wood'});for(let dx=-1;dx<=1;dx++)for(let dy=-1;dy<=1;dy++)for(let z=2;z<4;z++)objects.push({x:x+dx,y:y+dy,z,t:'leaf'});objects.push({x,y,z:4,t:'leaf'});}tree(-6,-3);tree(6,-4);tree(7,2);let f=frames[position];f.a.forEach((v,i)=>{let x=i-(f.a.length-1)/2,y=1,t=f.active.includes(i)?f.color:f.done.includes(i)?'diamond':'grass';for(let z=0;z<v*.55;z++)objects.push({x,y,z,t:z===Math.ceil(v*.55)-1?t:t==='grass'?'dirt':t});});for(let x=-5;x<=5;x++)objects.push({x,y:3,z:-.95,t:'stone'});objects.sort((a,b)=>{const depth=o=>(o.x+o.y)*Math.cos(angle)+(o.x-o.y)*Math.sin(angle);return depth(a)-depth(b)||a.z-b.z;});objects.forEach(o=>cube(o.x,o.y,o.z,o.t));f.a.forEach((v,i)=>{let x=i-(f.a.length-1)/2,[px,py]=point(x+.5,1.5,Math.ceil(v*.55)+.65);ctx.font=`bold ${Math.max(12,scale*.52)}px monospace`;ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillStyle='#24341e';ctx.fillRect(px-12,py-15,24,22);ctx.fillStyle=f.active.includes(i)?'#ffe5a2':'#f0f5e7';ctx.fillText(v,px,py+1);let [ix,iy]=point(x+.5,2.3,0);ctx.font='10px monospace';ctx.fillStyle='#eff5df';ctx.fillText(i,ix,iy+13);});}
